+- * the colour runs of the GMEM swap check, set by the boot so their command lines stay short. 0 when absent. */
++ * the colour runs of the GMEM swap check, set by the boot so their command lines stay short. 0 when absent. tum=a takes turns of
++ * eight seconds: Turnip's own choice, then GMEM wherever the pass can, so one boot's pass records (their mode and GPU times) hold
++ * both ways of rendering the same passes. */
+ #include <sys/sysctl.h>
